### Shared variables for the Panda Pocket request collection.
### Rider and the VS Code REST Client both read @-declarations from the file
### they are run in, so these are copied into each file rather than imported.

@gateway   = http://localhost:5000
@merchant  = http://localhost:5001
@invoice   = http://localhost:5002
@rate      = http://localhost:5003
@settlement = http://localhost:5004

### Health of the backing stores (day 1: Seq is the only one with an HTTP face)
GET http://localhost:5341/health
